        "id": 1080076
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-04-06T22:17:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "READ_ONCE is literally a (*(volatile type*)\u0026var), forcing compiler to re-read the value. Good point about potentially missing a bunch of reads here after enabling logging\nTBH even a plain atomic wouldn\u0027t help - need a barrier, which, I hope, is in the lock acquiring",
      "parentUuid": "65c9e07b_7338b876",
      "revId": "3ee52ff3367d84807454310cce5ed31732a33a3a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
